{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12164","headline":"赠东邻郑少府 · 钱起","name":"赠东邻郑少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一闻白雪唱，愿见清扬久。\n谁谓结绶来，得陪趋府後。\n小邑蓝溪上，卑栖惬所偶。\n忘言复连墙，片月亦携手。\n草色同春迳，莺声共高柳。\n美景百花时，平生一盃酒。\n圣朝法天地，以我爲刍狗。\n秩满归白云，期君访谷口。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}